# t2-diagonal fixture (mirrors demos/7-tiers/t2-diagonal.bqn)
# twoHanded is scaffold: all 61, so TwoHanded > 60 is total and the mask is nord alone, matching the .bqn's W.
n 5
col gold num 100 200 300 400 500
col nord bool 1 0 1 1 0
col twoHanded num 61 61 61 61 61
ja 金 gold
ja 北 nord
ja 両手 twoHanded
ja 前 prev
ja 行 row
ja 番号 index
ja 字 char
